    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37919" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπᾰκολούθ-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cognizance, concurrence,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PRyl.
				233.14
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γράμματα
				ἐπακολουθήσεως</span> documents in proof of
			<i>compliance,</i> i.e. <i>settlement</i> of debts, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1473.8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>consequence,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ᾽ ἐ.</span>
			<i>consequentially,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προηγουμένως,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Stoic.</u>
				2.333
			</span></i>, Stoic. ap.<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1015c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				M.Ant.
				6.44
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				1.194
			</span></i>; <i>result,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐεξία κατ᾽ ἐ. τῆς ὑγιείας
					συνισταμένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					19.382
				</span></i>
			.</div>
